		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading {"level":1} -->
<h1 class="wp-block-heading">Tell us about your project</h1>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Share a few details and we’ll follow up by email, then you’ll be redirected to book time with us.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>What we need:</strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Name and email</li>
<li>Company name (optional)</li>
<li>Short project description — what you’re building, goals, and timelines</li>
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>After you reach out, you can <a href="https://calendly.com/snwebdesignco/30min">schedule a 30-minute call</a> on Calendly.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><em>Web design — digital experiences that engage, convert, and rohan.</em></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
